{
    "title": "Arro: Credit Your Way",
    "description": "Get up to $200 credit limit with the Arro Card and immediately grow your credit limit while you learn how to master your finances. Are you ready to take control of your finances and learn how to manage your money? Meet Arro\u2014 the financial app that believes in you.\r\n\r\nApply for the Arro Card in 5 Minutes or Less\r\nOur goal is to give people a chance. We provide credit access at fair rates, regardless of your credit score. In fact, you only need a bank account to apply. The application can be completed in under 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nUse the Arro Credit Card Immediately\r\nGet immediate access to a virtual Arro Card while your physical Arro Card arrives in the mail. Whether you plan to use credit to pay essential bills \u2014 rent, utilities, gas \u2014 or you\u2019re just looking for an opportunity to build a better credit score, the Arro Mastercard credit card can be used immediately so you don\u2019t have to wait. Add your virtual Arro Card to your mobile wallet instantly to start building your credit.\r\n\r\nUnlock Rewards & Grow Your Credit\r\nWe believe that strong habits now lead to a healthier financial future. That\u2019s why we reward you for learning more about your personal finances and building good financial habits that stick. Grow your credit by achieving goals in the Arro app such as:\r\n\u2022\tCompleting bite size financial education lessons\r\n\u2022\tMaking back-to-back payments\r\n\u2022\tSigning up for autopay\r\n\u2022\tAnd more!\r\n\r\nMaster Your Personal Finances\r\nFinancial literacy is key to achieving financial freedom. Our in-app personal finance lessons include tips, hacks, and guides to better your credit score and personal finances. Lessons cover all of the topics below and more:\r\n\u2022\tManaging credit\r\n\u2022\tIncreasing your credit score\r\n\u2022\tBudgeting for the future\r\n\u2022\tSmart shopping tips\r\n\u2022\tSaving for the future\r\n\u2022\tInvesting for retirement\r\n\u2022\tSelecting the right bank accounts\r\n\u2022\tUnderstanding interest rates and debt payoff\r\n\u2022\tProtecting yourself against predatory lending\r\n\u2022\tPlanning for home ownership\r\n\u2022\tProtecting your health and your assets with insurance\r\n\u2022\tIncreasing your income\r\n\u2022\tUsing personal loans\r\n\r\nTrack your Credit Score for Free\r\nWith the Arro app, you can track your credit score in real-time to see your financial progress. We help you build your credit by reporting to all three major credit bureaus: TransUnion, Experian, and Equifax.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get up to $200 credit limit with the Arro Card and immediately grow your credit limit while you learn how to master your finances. Are you ready to take control of your finances and learn how to manage your money? Meet Arro\u2014 the financial app that believes in you.<br><br>Apply for the Arro Card in 5 Minutes or Less<br>Our goal is to give people a chance. We provide credit access at fair rates, regardless of your credit score. In fact, you only need a bank account to apply. The application can be completed in under 5 minutes.<br><br>Use the Arro Credit Card Immediately<br>Get immediate access to a virtual Arro Card while your physical Arro Card arrives in the mail. Whether you plan to use credit to pay essential bills \u2014 rent, utilities, gas \u2014 or you\u2019re just looking for an opportunity to build a better credit score, the Arro Mastercard credit card can be used immediately so you don\u2019t have to wait. Add your virtual Arro Card to your mobile wallet instantly to start building your credit.<br><br>Unlock Rewards &amp; Grow Your Credit<br>We believe that strong habits now lead to a healthier financial future. That\u2019s why we reward you for learning more about your personal finances and building good financial habits that stick. Grow your credit by achieving goals in the Arro app such as:<br>\u2022\tCompleting bite size financial education lessons<br>\u2022\tMaking back-to-back payments<br>\u2022\tSigning up for autopay<br>\u2022\tAnd more!<br><br>Master Your Personal Finances<br>Financial literacy is key to achieving financial freedom. Our in-app personal finance lessons include tips, hacks, and guides to better your credit score and personal finances. Lessons cover all of the topics below and more:<br>\u2022\tManaging credit<br>\u2022\tIncreasing your credit score<br>\u2022\tBudgeting for the future<br>\u2022\tSmart shopping tips<br>\u2022\tSaving for the future<br>\u2022\tInvesting for retirement<br>\u2022\tSelecting the right bank accounts<br>\u2022\tUnderstanding interest rates and debt payoff<br>\u2022\tProtecting yourself against predatory lending<br>\u2022\tPlanning for home ownership<br>\u2022\tProtecting your health and your assets with insurance<br>\u2022\tIncreasing your income<br>\u2022\tUsing personal loans<br><br>Track your Credit Score for Free<br>With the Arro app, you can track your credit score in real-time to see your financial progress. We help you build your credit by reporting to all three major credit bureaus: TransUnion, Experian, and Equifax.",
